            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Walk-in at Patron's Marine Lines office - minutes from Mumbai's Parel hospital cluster. Files with Charity Commissioner, GST Commissionerate, and Income Tax.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
